{"crw-nogi-38130":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お久しぶりです、すみません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちら元気です(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2017/04/17/0424866/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意外BREAK"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"インフルエンサーの全国握手会が大阪から始まりましたね☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は二曲参加してます。\nフルサイズでの披露だから緊張しますねぇ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"インフルエンサーのダンスも、身体に馴染んで楽しんで踊れるようになりました(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初は手足がついていかなくて苦戦したけど、踊れると楽しいもんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の全国握手会はゴールデンウィーク！名古屋！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お会いできるのを楽しみにしてます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2017/04/17/0424866/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2017/04/17/0424866/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2017/04/17/0424866/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ray"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなと一緒で楽しかった♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"